6246","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105214#issuecomment-2791126246","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105214","id":2791126246,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6mXTTm","user":{"login":"Grublady","id":29121925,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MTIxOTI1","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29121925?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady","html_url":"https://github.com/Grublady","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grublady/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-09T22:32:59Z","updated_at":"2025-04-09T22:32:59Z","body":"Thank you for your guidance!\r\n\r\nUpdated—no longer guts the use of overrides.\r\n\r\nInstead, it now guards against `is_sub_inspector` in `_update_theme`.\r\n\r\nThe timing of the initial update and of connecting/disconnecting signals has also been adjusted.\r\n\r\n> might've not fixed background update for sub-inspectors\r\n\r\nThey seem to be mostly working as far as I can tell.\r\nThe only thing I notice is that icons for resources don't update (which could be another PR).","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2791126246/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":